---
description: >-
  `agentflow.curve` (D733, #1378) draws every edge: straight segments here (`linear`), where
  the default draws rounded right angles. `flowchart.curve` no longer reaches an agentflow
  diagram, so the `basis` it sets here changes nothing.
config:
  agentflow:
    curve: linear
  flowchart:
    curve: basis
